1. Inquisitive 🔍
Meaning: Eager to learn or ask questions
Tamil: அறிந்துகொள்ள ஆர்வமுள்ள
Synonyms: Curious, Questioning
Antonym: Indifferent
🧠 Trick: Inquiry → Inquisitive
2. Perceptive 👀
Meaning: Quick to notice and understand things
Tamil: நுண்ணறிவு கொண்ட
Synonyms: Observant, Insightful
Antonym: Unobservant
🧠 Perceive = notice/understand
3. Astute 🧠
Meaning: Clever and good at judging situations
Tamil: கூர்மையான அறிவுடைய
Synonyms: Shrewd, Sharp, Clever
Antonym: Naive
🧠 Astute = sharp mind
4. Sagacious 🦉
Meaning: Having good judgment and wisdom
Tamil: ஞானமுள்ள / விவேகமான
Synonyms: Wise, Judicious, Prudent
Antonym: Foolish
🧠 Sage = wise person → Sagacious
5. Analytical 📊
Meaning: Examining something carefully and logically
Tamil: பகுத்தாய்வு செய்யும்
Synonyms: Logical, Systematic
Antonym: Illogical
🧠 Analysis → Analytical
6. Cerebral 🧠
Meaning: Intellectual; involving deep thinking
Tamil: அறிவுசார்
Synonyms: Intellectual, Thoughtful
Antonym: Superficial
🧠 Cerebrum = brain → Cerebral
7. Discerning 🎯
Meaning: Able to recognize differences and make good judgments
Tamil: நுணுக்கமாக வேறுபடுத்தி அறியும்
Synonyms: Perceptive, Judicious
Antonym: Uncritical
🧠 Discern = recognize the difference
8. Prudent ⚖️
Meaning: Wise and careful when making decisions
Tamil: விவேகமான / முன்னெச்சரிக்கையான
Synonyms: Sensible, Cautious, Wise
Antonym: Reckless
🧠 Prudent = Protect your future
9. Erudite 📚
Meaning: Having extensive knowledge, especially from study
Tamil: ஆழ்ந்த அறிவுடைய / புலமைமிக்க
Synonyms: Learned, Scholarly, Knowledgeable
Antonym: Ignorant
🧠 ERU-dite → "education" → highly educated
10. Ingenious 💡
Meaning: Clever, creative, and inventive
Tamil: புத்திசாலித்தனமான / புதுமையான
Synonyms: Innovative, Inventive, Clever
Antonym: Uncreative
🧠 Ingenious = Engineer-like cleverness
